{
  "cues": [
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.874,
      "lines": [
        "Amazon's experimental hiring tool",
        "allegedly ranked women lower."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "hook",
      "start": 3.874,
      "end": 5.78,
      "lines": [
        "Abandoning it took three years."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 6.1,
      "end": 8.982,
      "lines": [
        "Today, no company can",
        "afford to spend such time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 8.982,
      "end": 11.865,
      "lines": [
        "and effort and end up",
        "potentially causing harm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 11.865,
      "end": 15.79,
      "lines": [
        "The challenge is to govern AI",
        "responsibly and create real value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 17.6,
      "end": 22.377,
      "lines": [
        "In AI Center X, you start with the",
        "AI Canvas: the CV Screening Assistant's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 22.377,
      "end": 25.863,
      "lines": [
        "business problem, its data,",
        "and the people it affects."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 25.863,
      "end": 27.67,
      "lines": [
        "Then you simulate the risks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.552,
      "lines": [
        "An AI agent suggests risks, each cited"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 2.552,
      "end": 6.648,
      "lines": [
        "from the MIT AI Risk Repository",
        "and the AI Incident Database."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 6.648,
      "end": 9.535,
      "lines": [
        "You select the relevant",
        "ones and save them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 9.535,
      "end": 11.55,
      "lines": [
        "Now, generate the mitigations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.436,
      "lines": [
        "For every saved risk,",
        "the agent proposes mitigations,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 3.436,
      "end": 7.52,
      "lines": [
        "each classed by MIT's draft",
        "taxonomy and tied to the EU AI Act."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 7.52,
      "end": 9.271,
      "lines": [
        "Again, you select and save."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 9.271,
      "end": 11.41,
      "lines": [
        "Next come the model enhancements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.045,
      "lines": [
        "The agent shows how to put",
        "those mitigations into effect:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 3.045,
      "end": 5.983,
      "lines": [
        "fine-tuning on audited shortlists,",
        "two checking agents,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 5.983,
      "end": 8.388,
      "lines": [
        "and learning from audited",
        "recruiter feedback."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 8.388,
      "end": 9.83,
      "lines": [
        "You save the ones you need."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f5",
      "scene": "trace",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.49,
      "lines": [
        "From idea to business value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f5",
      "scene": "end",
      "start": 3.5,
      "end": 6.85,
      "lines": [
        "AI Center X: making innovation",
        "and governance work together."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
